{"seq":1,"slug":"bcc-bpftrace","title":"BCC 与 bpftrace 快速追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/bcc-bpftrace","wordCount":1249,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"bcc-与-bpftrace-快速追踪\">BCC 与 bpftrace 快速追踪</h1><p>BCC（BPF Compiler Collection）和 bpftrace 是 eBPF 生态中面向「快速诊断」的两大工具。BCC 提供 100+ 个即用的命令行追踪工具和 Python/C 混合编程 API；bpftrace 则用类 AWK 的高级语言实现内核追踪的 one-liner。二者共享同一目标：让工程师在几秒钟内获得内核级的系统洞察，无需编译 C 程序或理解 libbpf 的复杂性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>BCC 与 bpftrace 是 eBPF「快速诊断」光谱的两端，共享同一目标：让工程师在几秒内获得内核级洞察，无需编写完整 C 程序。二者的关键差异在数据面/控制面的分工方式：BCC 用 C 写内核态、用 Python 写用户态，表达力强但启动需运行时编译（依赖 LLVM 与内核头文件）；bpftrace 用类 AWK 的单一语言描述探针与动作，启动快、上手易，但表达能力限于脚本级。选择的依据是任务时长与复杂度——一次性假设验证用 bpftrace，工具开发与复杂输出用 BCC，长期生产部署则交给 libbpf。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bcc-工具集架构\">BCC 工具集架构</h2><p>BCC 的核心设计是「Python 控制面 + C 数据面」——用 C 编写内核态 eBPF 程序（高性能采集），用 Python 编写用户态逻辑（加载程序、读取 map、格式化输出）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[BCC Python API] --&gt; B[C 源码字符串]&#10;    B --&gt; C[LLVM/Clang 运行时编译]&#10;    C --&gt; D[eBPF 字节码]&#10;    D --&gt; E[bpf 系统调用加载]&#10;    E --&gt; F[内核 Verifier]&#10;    F --&gt; G[JIT 编译执行]&#10;    G --&gt; H[Map 数据收集]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Python 读取并展示]\">flowchart TD\n    A[BCC Python API] --&gt; B[C 源码字符串]\n    B --&gt; C[LLVM/Clang 运行时编译]\n    C --&gt; D[eBPF 字节码]\n    D --&gt; E[bpf 系统调用加载]\n    E --&gt; F[内核 Verifier]\n    F --&gt; G[JIT 编译执行]\n    G --&gt; H[Map 数据收集]\n    H --&gt; I[Python 读取并展示]</pre><h3 id=\"核心工具速查\">核心工具速查</h3><p>BCC 的 tools/ 目录包含覆盖网络、磁盘、CPU、内存、文件系统等维度的追踪工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>execsnoop</code></td>\n<td>追踪所有进程创建</td>\n<td>发现异常进程、审计容器行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opensnoop</code></td>\n<td>追踪文件打开操作</td>\n<td>定位配置文件加载、发现异常访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>biolatency</code></td>\n<td>块 IO 延迟直方图</td>\n<td>磁盘性能分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tcpconnect</code></td>\n<td>追踪主动 TCP 连接</td>\n<td>服务依赖发现、异常外连检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tcpretrans</code></td>\n<td>TCP 重传追踪</td>\n<td>网络质量分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>funclatency</code></td>\n<td>函数延迟分布</td>\n<td>定位慢函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>runqlat</code></td>\n<td>CPU 运行队列延迟</td>\n<td>CPU 饱和度分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cachestat</code></td>\n<td>页缓存命中率</td>\n<td>内存压力评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ext4slower</code></td>\n<td>慢 ext4 操作</td>\n<td>文件系统瓶颈定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>profile</code></td>\n<td>CPU 采样火焰图数据</td>\n<td>热点函数定位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"bcc-python-编程模型\">BCC Python 编程模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env python3&#10;from bcc import BPF&#10;&#10;# 内核态 C 程序&#10;prog = &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;#include &lt;uapi/linux/ptrace.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;net/sock.h&gt;&#10;&#10;struct event_t {&#10;    u32 pid;&#10;    u32 daddr;&#10;    u16 dport;&#10;    char comm[16];&#10;};&#10;&#10;BPF_PERF_OUTPUT(events);&#10;&#10;int trace_connect(struct pt_regs *ctx, struct sock *sk)&#10;{&#10;    struct event_t evt = {};&#10;    evt.pid = bpf_get_current_pid_tgid() &gt;&gt; 32;&#10;    evt.daddr = sk-&gt;__sk_common.skc_daddr;&#10;    evt.dport = sk-&gt;__sk_common.skc_dport;&#10;    bpf_get_current_comm(&amp;evt.comm, sizeof(evt.comm));&#10;    events.perf_submit(ctx, &amp;evt, sizeof(evt));&#10;    return 0;&#10;}&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;b = BPF(text=prog)&#10;b.attach_kprobe(event=&quot;tcp_v4_connect&quot;, fn_name=&quot;trace_connect&quot;)&#10;&#10;def print_event(cpu, data, size):&#10;    event = b[&quot;events&quot;].event(data)&#10;    print(f&quot;PID={event.pid} COMM={event.comm.decode()} &quot;&#10;          f&quot;-&gt; {inet_ntoa(event.daddr)}:{ntohs(event.dport)}&quot;)&#10;&#10;b[&quot;events&quot;].open_perf_buffer(print_event)&#10;while True:&#10;    b.perf_buffer_poll()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env python3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bcc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BPF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 内核态 C 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prog </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">#include &#x3C;uapi/linux/ptrace.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">#include &#x3C;net/sock.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">struct event_t {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u32 pid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u32 daddr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    u16 dport;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    char comm[16];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BPF_PERF_OUTPUT(events);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">int trace_connect(struct pt_regs *ctx, struct sock *sk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    struct event_t evt = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    evt.pid = bpf_get_current_pid_tgid() >> 32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    evt.daddr = sk->__sk_common.skc_daddr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    evt.dport = sk->__sk_common.skc_dport;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    bpf_get_current_comm(&#x26;evt.comm, sizeof(evt.comm));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    events.perf_submit(ctx, &#x26;evt, sizeof(evt));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    return 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BPF(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prog)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b.attach_kprobe(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tcp_v4_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fn_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"trace_connect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> print_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cpu, data, size):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].event(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PID=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event.pid</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> COMM=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">event.comm.decode()</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inet_ntoa(event.daddr)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ntohs(event.dport)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].open_perf_buffer(print_event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    b.perf_buffer_poll()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"bpftrace-语言详解\">bpftrace 语言详解</h2><p>bpftrace 是面向 one-liner 和短脚本的高级追踪语言。其语法直觉性强、学习曲线平缓，适合实时调试和快速验证假设。</p>\n<h3 id=\"语言结构\">语言结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"probe_type:probe_name[/filter/] { action }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>probe_type:probe_name[/filter/] { action }</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言元素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>probe</td>\n<td>挂载点声明</td>\n<td><code>kprobe:vfs_read</code>, <code>tracepoint:syscalls:sys_enter_open</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter</td>\n<td>执行条件（可选）</td>\n<td><code>/comm == &quot;nginx&quot;/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>action</td>\n<td>花括号内的语句</td>\n<td><code>{ @count[comm] = count(); }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内置变量</td>\n<td><code>pid</code>, <code>tid</code>, <code>comm</code>, <code>nsecs</code>, <code>cpu</code></td>\n<td><code>printf(&quot;%d %s\\n&quot;, pid, comm)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>map 变量</td>\n<td><code>@name</code> 前缀</td>\n<td><code>@hist = hist(nsecs)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合函数</td>\n<td><code>count()</code>, <code>sum()</code>, <code>hist()</code>, <code>lhist()</code>, <code>avg()</code></td>\n<td><code>@bytes = sum(retval)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"经典-one-liner-集合\">经典 one-liner 集合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 追踪所有进程创建，显示父子关系&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:syscalls:sys_enter_execve {&#10;    printf(&quot;%d %s -&gt; %s\\n&quot;, pid, comm, str(args-&gt;filename));&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# TCP 连接延迟直方图（connect 到 established 的时间）&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;kprobe:tcp_v4_connect { @start[tid] = nsecs; }&#10;kretprobe:tcp_v4_connect /@start[tid]/ {&#10;    @usecs = hist((nsecs - @start[tid]) / 1000);&#10;    delete(@start[tid]);&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 按进程统计 read 系统调用的字节数&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:syscalls:sys_exit_read /args-&gt;ret &gt; 0/ {&#10;    @bytes[comm] = sum(args-&gt;ret);&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# VFS read 延迟分布（微秒）&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;kprobe:vfs_read { @start[tid] = nsecs; }&#10;kretprobe:vfs_read /@start[tid]/ {&#10;    @us = hist((nsecs - @start[tid]) / 1000);&#10;    delete(@start[tid]);&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 每秒系统调用计数 Top-10&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_enter {&#10;    @[comm] = count();&#10;} interval:s:1 { print(@, 10); clear(@); }&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追踪所有进程创建，显示父子关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:syscalls:sys_enter_execve {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    printf(\"%d %s -> %s\\n\", pid, comm, str(args->filename));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># TCP 连接延迟直方图（connect 到 established 的时间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'kprobe:tcp_v4_connect { @start[tid] = nsecs; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kretprobe:tcp_v4_connect /@start[tid]/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @usecs = hist((nsecs - @start[tid]) / 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    delete(@start[tid]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按进程统计 read 系统调用的字节数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:syscalls:sys_exit_read /args->ret > 0/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @bytes[comm] = sum(args->ret);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># VFS read 延迟分布（微秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'kprobe:vfs_read { @start[tid] = nsecs; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kretprobe:vfs_read /@start[tid]/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @us = hist((nsecs - @start[tid]) / 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    delete(@start[tid]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每秒系统调用计数 Top-10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_enter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @[comm] = count();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} interval:s:1 { print(@, 10); clear(@); }'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"bpftrace-脚本编写\">bpftrace 脚本编写</h3><p>更复杂的分析场景使用 <code>.bt</code> 脚本文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// tcp_retrans.bt - TCP 重传详细追踪&#10;#!/usr/bin/env bpftrace&#10;&#10;#include &lt;net/sock.h&gt;&#10;&#10;tracepoint:tcp:tcp_retransmit_skb&#10;{&#10;    $sk = (struct sock *)args-&gt;skaddr;&#10;    $inet = (struct inet_sock *)$sk;&#10;&#10;    $daddr = ntop(AF_INET, args-&gt;daddr);&#10;    $saddr = ntop(AF_INET, args-&gt;saddr);&#10;    $dport = args-&gt;dport;&#10;    $sport = args-&gt;sport;&#10;    $state = args-&gt;state;&#10;&#10;    printf(&quot;%-8d %-16s %s:%d -&gt; %s:%d state=%d\\n&quot;,&#10;        pid, comm, $saddr, $sport, $daddr, $dport, $state);&#10;&#10;    @retrans[comm, $daddr, $dport] = count();&#10;}&#10;&#10;END&#10;{&#10;    printf(&quot;\\n=== Retransmission Summary ===\\n&quot;);&#10;    print(@retrans);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tcp_retrans.bt - TCP 重传详细追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">#</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">usr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">env bpftrace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;net/sock.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tracepoint:tcp:tcp_retransmit_skb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $sk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)args->skaddr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $inet </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inet_sock </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)$sk;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $daddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ntop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AF_INET, args->daddr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $saddr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ntop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(AF_INET, args->saddr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $dport </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> args->dport;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $sport </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> args->sport;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    $state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> args->state;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%-8d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> %-16s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> %s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> state=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pid, comm, $saddr, $sport, $daddr, $dport, $state);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">retrans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[comm, $daddr, $dport] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=== Retransmission Summary ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@retrans);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"bcc-vs-bpftrace-选型\">BCC vs bpftrace 选型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{追踪需求} --&gt; B{是否需要复杂逻辑?}&#10;    B --&gt;|简单聚合/one-liner| C[bpftrace]&#10;    B --&gt;|复杂处理/自定义输出| D{是否生产长期运行?}&#10;    D --&gt;|短期调试| E[BCC Python]&#10;    D --&gt;|生产级部署| F[libbpf + CO-RE]&#10;    C --&gt; G[适合: 现场调试、假设验证、快速统计]&#10;    E --&gt; H[适合: 原型验证、工具开发、复杂格式化]&#10;    F --&gt; I[适合: 持续监控、DaemonSet 部署]\">flowchart TD\n    A{追踪需求} --&gt; B{是否需要复杂逻辑?}\n    B --&gt;|简单聚合/one-liner| C[bpftrace]\n    B --&gt;|复杂处理/自定义输出| D{是否生产长期运行?}\n    D --&gt;|短期调试| E[BCC Python]\n    D --&gt;|生产级部署| F[libbpf + CO-RE]\n    C --&gt; G[适合: 现场调试、假设验证、快速统计]\n    E --&gt; H[适合: 原型验证、工具开发、复杂格式化]\n    F --&gt; I[适合: 持续监控、DaemonSet 部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>bpftrace</th>\n<th>BCC</th>\n<th>libbpf (参考)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低（类 AWK）</td>\n<td>中（Python + C）</td>\n<td>高（纯 C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动时间</td>\n<td>&lt; 1s</td>\n<td>3-10s（编译）</td>\n<td>即时（预编译）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时依赖</td>\n<td>bpftrace 二进制</td>\n<td>Python + LLVM + 头文件</td>\n<td>无（静态链接）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表达能力</td>\n<td>中（脚本级）</td>\n<td>高（任意 Python）</td>\n<td>最高（任意 C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产适用性</td>\n<td>临时诊断</td>\n<td>工具开发/原型</td>\n<td>生产级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核版本兼容</td>\n<td>CO-RE 支持（v0.16+）</td>\n<td>需匹配头文件</td>\n<td>CO-RE 原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制分发</td>\n<td>单文件</td>\n<td>需 Python 环境</td>\n<td>单文件静态链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境使用模式\">生产环境使用模式</h2><h3 id=\"安全注意事项\">安全注意事项</h3><p>BCC 和 bpftrace 默认需要 root 权限（<code>CAP_SYS_ADMIN</code> 或 <code>CAP_BPF + CAP_PERFMON</code>）。在生产环境中：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>紧急调试</td>\n<td>kubectl exec 进入特权 Pod</td>\n<td>临时使用，事后删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性采集</td>\n<td>预编译的 bpftrace 脚本 + CronJob</td>\n<td>减少运行时攻击面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续监控</td>\n<td>libbpf 工具 DaemonSet</td>\n<td>无需 LLVM，最小权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发测试</td>\n<td>本地 VM / Kind 集群</td>\n<td>安全隔离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"bcc-libbpf-tools-bcc-的现代替代\">BCC libbpf-tools：BCC 的现代替代</h3><p>BCC 项目中的 <code>libbpf-tools/</code> 目录包含所有经典工具的 CO-RE 版本——用 libbpf 重写，编译为独立静态二进制，无需 Python 或 LLVM 运行时依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 传统 BCC 方式（需要 Python + 头文件）&#10;sudo python3 /usr/share/bcc/tools/biolatency&#10;&#10;# libbpf-tools 方式（单一二进制，CO-RE 可移植）&#10;sudo ./biolatency\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 传统 BCC 方式（需要 Python + 头文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/share/bcc/tools/biolatency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># libbpf-tools 方式（单一二进制，CO-RE 可移植）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./biolatency</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些工具保持与原版相同的命令行接口和输出格式，但启动更快（无编译延迟）、部署更简（单文件拷贝）、跨内核版本运行（CO-RE）。生产环境建议优先使用 libbpf-tools 版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见诊断流程\">常见诊断流程</h2><p><strong>性能抖动诊断的典型 bpftrace 流程</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 确认 CPU 是否饱和&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;software:cpu-clock:1000000 { @[comm] = count(); }&#39; -d 5&#10;&#10;# 2. 检查运行队列延迟&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:sched:sched_switch {&#10;    @[comm] = hist(curtask-&gt;se.statistics.wait_sum);&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 3. 定位慢系统调用&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_enter { @start[tid] = nsecs; }&#10;tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_exit /@start[tid]/ {&#10;    $lat = nsecs - @start[tid];&#10;    if ($lat &gt; 1000000) {  // &gt; 1ms&#10;        printf(&quot;%d %s syscall=%d lat=%d us\\n&quot;,&#10;            pid, comm, @start[tid], $lat/1000);&#10;    }&#10;    delete(@start[tid]);&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;# 4. 追踪高延迟 IO&#10;bpftrace -e &#39;tracepoint:block:block_rq_issue { @start[args-&gt;dev, args-&gt;sector] = nsecs; }&#10;tracepoint:block:block_rq_complete /@start[args-&gt;dev, args-&gt;sector]/ {&#10;    @usecs = hist((nsecs - @start[args-&gt;dev, args-&gt;sector]) / 1000);&#10;    delete(@start[args-&gt;dev, args-&gt;sector]);&#10;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 确认 CPU 是否饱和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'software:cpu-clock:1000000 { @[comm] = count(); }'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 检查运行队列延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:sched:sched_switch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @[comm] = hist(curtask->se.statistics.wait_sum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 定位慢系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_enter { @start[tid] = nsecs; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tracepoint:raw_syscalls:sys_exit /@start[tid]/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    $lat = nsecs - @start[tid];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    if ($lat > 1000000) {  // > 1ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        printf(\"%d %s syscall=%d lat=%d us\\n\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            pid, comm, @start[tid], $lat/1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    delete(@start[tid]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 追踪高延迟 IO</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftrace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'tracepoint:block:block_rq_issue { @start[args->dev, args->sector] = nsecs; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tracepoint:block:block_rq_complete /@start[args->dev, args->sector]/ {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @usecs = hist((nsecs - @start[args->dev, args->sector]) / 1000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    delete(@start[args->dev, args->sector]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>定位分野</strong>：bpftrace 面向 one-liner 与现场调试，BCC 面向工具开发与原型，libbpf/CO-RE 面向生产长期运行</li>\n<li><strong>BCC 架构</strong>：Python 控制面 + C 数据面，提供 100+ 即用工具；代价是运行时编译依赖 LLVM 与内核头文件</li>\n<li><strong>bpftrace 语言</strong>：<code>probe/filter/action</code> 三段式结构，<code>@</code> map 变量与 <code>count()/hist()/sum()</code> 聚合函数覆盖典型需求</li>\n<li><strong>启动与依赖</strong>：bpftrace 启动 &lt; 1s 且单文件分发，BCC 启动需数秒编译且依赖 Python 环境</li>\n<li><strong>迁移路径</strong>：生产环境优先使用 libbpf-tools 中的 CO-RE 版本——接口兼容原版，但启动更快、部署更简、可跨内核版本</li>\n<li><strong>安全注意</strong>：两者默认需要 root 或 <code>CAP_BPF + CAP_PERFMON</code>，周期性采集应改用预编译脚本或 DaemonSet</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"libbpf-co-re\">libbpf 与 CO-RE</a> 详解生产级 eBPF 开发的标准路径；<a href=\"cilium-hubble\">Cilium 与 Hubble</a> 展示平台级工具如何封装底层 eBPF 能力。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"BCC 与 bpftrace 快速追踪","id":"bcc-与-bpftrace-快速追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BCC 工具集架构","id":"bcc-工具集架构"},{"level":3,"text":"核心工具速查","id":"核心工具速查"},{"level":3,"text":"BCC Python 编程模型","id":"bcc-python-编程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"bpftrace 语言详解","id":"bpftrace-语言详解"},{"level":3,"text":"语言结构","id":"语言结构"},{"level":3,"text":"经典 one-liner 集合","id":"经典-one-liner-集合"},{"level":3,"text":"bpftrace 脚本编写","id":"bpftrace-脚本编写"},{"level":2,"text":"BCC vs bpftrace 选型","id":"bcc-vs-bpftrace-选型"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境使用模式","id":"生产环境使用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"安全注意事项","id":"安全注意事项"},{"level":3,"text":"BCC libbpf-tools：BCC 的现代替代","id":"bcc-libbpf-tools-bcc-的现代替代"},{"level":2,"text":"常见诊断流程","id":"常见诊断流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安全监控与运行时检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/observability/security-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"libbpf 与 CO-RE 生产级开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/libbpf-co-re"}}